   "bank": "0.1",
   "jp": "{1c:12}{0b:08}【 クムラン 】{0b:09}\n昨日言いましたよね。{1a}自分の足を使わなければ、\n自ら汗を流さなければ、\n本当の研究は出来ないと。{1a}この部屋に閉じこもっていては\n新たな発見はありませんよ。{0c:290e091501}",
   "read": "{1c:12}{0b:08}【 クムラン 】{0b:09}\n昨日言いましたよね。{1a}自分の足を使わなければ、\n自ら汗を流さなければ、\n本当の研究は出来ないと。{1a}この部屋に閉じこもっていては\n新たな発見はありませんよ。{0c:290e091501}",
   "raw": null,
   "en": "{1c:12}{0b:08}【 Qumran 】{0b:09}\nI told you yesterday, did I not?{1a}Without using your own feet, without\nshedding your own sweat, you cannot do\ntrue research.{1a}You will make no new discoveries shut up\nin this room.{0c:290e091501}",
   "status": "done",
   "tl": "I told you yesterday, did I not? // Without using your own feet, without shedding your own sweat, you cannot do true research. // You will make no new discoveries shut up in this room."
